# Digital Video: How It Works, What It Can Do, and When It's Coming.

**Authors:** Anderson, Charles

## Abstract
Discusses the advantages and disadvantages of digital television signals as opposed to analog signals and considers how &quot;going digital&quot; might affect existing analog instructional television systems. The costs, quality, and flexibility of using digital television signals are examined. (MER)

